{"id":"wb-7-1849","name":"三灶岛侵华日军罪行遗迹","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"三灶岛侵华日军罪行遗迹","text":"三灶岛侵华日军罪行遗迹位于广东省珠海市金湾区三灶镇，包括万人坟、千人坟、慰安所、日文摩崖石刻、碉堡等遗址，1983年被列为广东省文物保护单位，2013年被列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位，2015年被列入国家级抗战纪念设施、遗址名录。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E7%81%B6%E5%B2%9B%E4%BE%B5%E5%8D%8E%E6%97%A5%E5%86%9B%E7%BD%AA%E8%A1%8C%E9%81%97%E8%BF%B9","revisionId":94086411,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94086411","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/2c13b5cd6922a83f5ebad185.jpg","title":"Zhuhai_Sanzaodao_Wanrenfen_Yizhi_20160608.104833.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Zhuhai_Sanzaodao_Wanrenfen_Yizhi_20160608.104833.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/Zhuhai_Sanzaodao_Wanrenfen_Yizhi_20160608.104833.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"木子弓长","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​三灶岛侵华日军罪行遗迹-万人坟遗址","width":320,"height":214}}